    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm starting to prep the quarterly efficiency report for the board. I want to keep our manual review overhead as low as possible this time around since we've been hitting our targets. Did the automated scans pick up anything that actually looks like it needs a manual deep-dive, or can we clear this quarter as \"low-risk\"?",
